# Accuracy experiment H2b: the full internal A16 path is not compilable
# because Hailo-8 cannot carry A16 through resize1_output_reshape.  Retain
# the supported, guide-recommended boundary-only rescue for the sensitive
# entropy-model mean tensor; all internal h_s nodes stay at baseline A8.
quantization_param(bn_h_s/output_layer1, precision_mode=a16_w16)
